/.stack-work/
/dist-newstyle/

# Julia
*.jl.cov
*.jl.mem
/Manifest.toml

# Logs
*.log
/logs/

# NIF build artifacts
#
# opsm_ex/native/*/Cargo.lock was ignored here until 2026-10-25, which is why
# neither NIF crate had a committed lock: `cargo build --locked` could not have
# worked, and `mix test` built whatever the resolver happened to pick that day.
# A Cargo.lock belongs to a binary or a NIF crate, not to a library that is
# consumed by version range. These are NIFs. They are committed now, and
# `Toolchain pins → Lockfiles are tracked` fails if one disappears again.
opsm_ex/priv/native/

# OS & Editor
*.swo
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db

# Python (SaltStack only)
*.py[cod]
.venv/
__pycache__/

# ReScript
*.ast
*.cmt
/.bsb.lock
/lib/bs/

# Rust
# Cargo.lock  # Keep for binaries

